@page "/me"

<PageTitle>About me — magishira.dev</PageTitle>

<section class="about">
    <div>
        <h1>About me</h1>
        <p class="lead">I'm Shira. On a résumé, I'm Elane Faisal-Sage. IT professional by trade, audio engineer by background, photographer and gamer off the clock.</p>
        <p>I came to IT through audio. Running the sound and lighting team at Hug High School meant running the network under it, and that turned into deploying computers for the University of Nevada, Reno in 2024.</p>
        <p>These days I lead the endpoint-management student team there and serve as president of Nevada eSports. The formal version is on the <a href="/experience">experience</a> page.</p>
        <p>Email is best: <a href="mailto:shira@magishira.dev">shira@magishira.dev</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="now">
        <h2>Lately</h2>
        <ul class="plain">
            <li>Working on the web team for SNAFU Con 2026</li>
            <li>Playing Final Fantasy XIV for the story, as a Bard</li>
            <li>Rebuilding this site in Blazor</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mute">Updated September 13, 2026.</p>
    </aside>
</section>

<section id="offclock">
    <h2>Off the clock</h2>
    <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Games</h3>
            <p>Final Fantasy XIV, where I main Bard and play mostly for the story. Classic osu! on a keypad and tablet. And Nevada eSports events, from Welcome Week LAN to Break the Internet, a 12-hour event in the student union ballrooms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Photography</h3>
            <p>Most of my free time goes here these days. I tend to shoot my surroundings, sometimes people, and I do grad photos. A few favorites are in the <a href="/#photos">gallery</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Live sound</h3>
            <p>Where this all started, and mostly retired now. I still mix for Nevada eSports events when the Reno Video Game Symphony performs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Making</h3>
            <p>3D printing, and the UNR 3D Printing Club, whose wiki I run.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
